          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kueny Dee-bid ala Kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu thuk duëli I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ben kä Dee-bid kä Ɣɛb-ron, cukɛ wee i̱, “Nɛnɛ, kɛ kɔn ri̱ŋdu kä riɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ gua̱a̱th ëë ci wä, mëë Thɔɔl ɛ kuäära, ɛ ji̱n ɛ nëë la ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl a bo̱th ko̱o̱r. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ji̱ jiök i̱, ‘Bia̱ yieen nɛɛnikä ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä bia̱ rueecdiɛn.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu bööth I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ben kä kuäär kä Ɣɛb-ron. Kä cu kuäär ni Dee-bid ruac mat kɛ kɛ kä Ɣɛb-ron nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä cukɛ Dee-bid kuany ala kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë tok Dee-bid kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k diëëth, kä cuɛ ruec kɛ run ti jiɛɛn ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Ɣɛb-ron cuɛ Juda ruac kɛ run bärɔw wi̱cdɛ päth bäkɛl. Kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛɛliw amäni Juda kɛ run ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ni Dee-bid kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ wä, wa Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wec ji̱ Yɛ-buth ma̱k, tëë jiök kɛ Dee-bid i̱, “/Ci bi ben ɛn wa̱nɛ, bi ciöör kɛnɛ ŋöt ji̱ gaŋ ni raar.” Cu nɔmɔ a ca̱riɛn i̱, “Dee-bid /cɛ rɔ bi luäŋ kɛ ben ɛn wa̱nɛ mi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dee-bid wecdiɛn in bum ni Dha-yɔn ka̱n, min ci ku la wec Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wee ɛn cäŋ ëë, “Ɛn ram bi ji̱ Yɛ-buth näk, a jɛ wä kɛ rɛy lo̱o̱lä pi̱i̱ni bɛ ciöör kɛnɛ ŋöt wä ma̱k, kɛ ɣöö lo̱k lɔcdä kɛ.” Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ la jɛ a larkɛ i̱, “/Ci ciöör kɛ ŋöt bi ben duëël.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ciɛŋ ni wec mi bum bum, kä cua ja cɔli wec Dee-bid. Kä cu Dee-bid wec täth ɛ go̱o̱lɛ jɛ a känɛ jɛ ni kä Milo a wä rɛc ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid buɔ̱m a lɔ̱ŋ, kɛ ɣöö te Kuoth Nhial ni Kuoth in la Ruey Ɣɔaa kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣi-ram kuäär Dhor Dee-bid jäk kä naath naŋ kɛ jiɛɛn ŋuer, amäni ŋa̱a̱t jiɛn, kɛ ta̱a̱th tin bä Dee-bid lät kä duel kuäärä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial jɛ jak kä kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kuäärɛ kap nhial kɛ kui̱ nɛɛnikɛ ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mëë ci Dee-bid ɣöth kä Ɣɛb-ron bëë kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, cuɛ kuɛɛn kɛ män ti ŋuan kɛnɛ luɔɔm ti ŋuan. Cuɛ tekɛ dhɔɔl ti ŋuan kɛnɛ nyier ti cua da̱p jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ti̱ti̱ kɛ ciööt gan tin ca da̱p jɛ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, Cä-muwä, Co-bab, Na-than, Thɔ-lo-mon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yib-ɣar, Ɛli-cuwa, Nɛ-pɛg, Ya-pia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛli-cama, Ɛl-yada, Ɛ-li-pa-lɛt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Dee-bid kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö ca Dee-bid kuany ala kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, cu kɛn diaal jiɛɛn wa Dee-bid go̱r. Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ liŋ kä cuɛ wä ti̱ecni tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt rɔ̱ ben däk kä piny rɛy lo̱o̱lä ji̱ Rɛpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Kuoth Nhial thiec i̱, “Ɣän bä wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt? Kä bikɛ ka̱m ɣä?” Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɛ loc i̱, “Wër, kɛ ɣöö ɛ puc bä kɛn ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ka̱m ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ben kä Baal-pɛ-ra-dhim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baal-pɛ-ra-dhim.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lotdɛ ni ɣöö to̱l Kuoth Nhial naath raar. Kuɛnɛ kä 2 Tham 5:20.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", kä cu Dee-bid kɛ joc ɛn wi̱ni. Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ tɛ̈rä joc nhiamdä, ce̱tnikɛ pul mi lɛny pikɛ.” Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cua gua̱th ɛmɔ cɔl i̱ Baal-pɛ-ra-dhim raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kuthkiɛn ba̱ny ɛn wi̱ni, kä cu Dee-bid kɛ naŋ kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt rɔ̱ nyɔk kɛ luny jɔk, kä cukɛ rɔ da̱k piny rɛy lo̱o̱lä ji̱ Rɛpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dee-bid Kuoth Nhial thiec, cuɛ loc i̱, “/Cu wä a lotdi ni kɔriɛn. Wër go̱l nikɛ, kä mak nikɛ kɛ kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ min lot ni jiath baltham",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "baltham.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jɛn ɛ jiath mi puɔl puɔl mi la la̱tkɛ ŋɔak, kä jɛn tëë kɛ ŋuäny mi gɔaa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
